  clock: 2  # c295
  nonce: c295  # c295
  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0039, merged in PR #4181): the undocumented additive in-degree boost at entrypoints.py:1504-1507 is exactly the class of ranking adjustment the ruling relocates out of confidence into the new rank_score field. The fix is to move the boost to rank_score and document it, leaving confidence as pure detection reliability. Waits on the implementation."  # c295
