- op: discuss  # bacb
  at: '2026-07-13T00:59:12Z'  # bacb
  by: agent  # bacb
  actor: jgstern_agent  # bacb
  clock: 4  # bacb
  nonce: bacb  # bacb
  message: "FIXED (ADR-0039 ruling 3). The undocumented additive in-degree connectivity boost (cap +0.35, library_export) at entrypoints.py mutated ep.confidence in place. It now mutates ep.rank_score instead (ranking prominence, not detection reliability), documented inline as WI-dojor + ADR-0039 R3. Behavioral evidence: self-analysis shows entrypoint confidence values are all clean construction-tier bases (no boost-inflated confidence), while rank_score carries the boost (range [0.318, 1.000]). awaits_bakeoff_validation."  # bacb
