  message: "BAKEOFF-VALIDATED: moved -> tag stripped. DEEP cohort deep-20260623-134237 iter-003 (schema 0.14.6 / confidence_model evidence-v2, post-thread-A), 8 repos: express/caddy/spring-petclinic/zoxide/SwiftyJSON/sherpa-csharp/apollo-server/pretix. Entrypoint rank_score present on every entrypoint and carries the in-degree connectivity boost: rank_score>confidence for in-degree entrypoints (pretix 365, sherpa 48, spring 11); the few with rank==conf are zero-in-degree entrypoints. Confidence untouched by the boost."  # 2e1a
